# 13. UI Principles

## Priorities

- Fast
- Minimal
- Mobile-first
- Large tap targets
- No login required
- Few clicks as possible

## Avoid

- Popup spam
- Complex navigation
- Slow loading
- Heavy animation
- Long forms

